8B2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iryaW3Oesb0Q7kNvwF4F6oG&_nc_oc=Adk9P_lKyTU5tjTscIdIDnOyNWeTriP-fPqs5yJUQBYEAG9Z9k8t--K0w6FtMEKAyBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzoBL4Wx7OZPNMAKsFWFv6RHnSWsg70q5VvBNkyyfwCSA&oe=69B6A5D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bv_yPQmaJoYQ7kNvwEp-Oic&_nc_oc=AdnbV3DzeqPoih29r3znmx5DnepTr75o70Ybem487VLAgb-YvyBcFFU5v8J-joBNoy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz31afz0phDFN1tSdVzZf6zUbyMz5HacUTfyNtbcmCMyw&oe=69B6AB15"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ppu8feDCtVIQ7kNvwFIGm46&_nc_oc=Adn-25pW2_Lq6PJ2J5B93IF8arTizSbiC_C3hfW2BDDil0ZLH_cV78lRXXjUnnc435o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfywDJQ3I5QRh40jgFkFKffc3W133k4-RRfq2iK8Z--yvQ&oe=69B6BEC2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0XuYOQEx_98Q7kNvwH5DspR&_nc_oc=AdnfCJZUgffYBScX3jDSIIEUcTWXDa5ahdmtBPeVzcm5kXbiRMakIVHq84NAKDBi4bw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyQ1Au1gkIw__J4B9At1QP4rThyAtSkHi0W5o1uuQbmaw&oe=69B6A544"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=twFpapNvynAQ7kNvwEDp32h&_nc_oc=AdnIy1zXxNwR2to6Qf8ZBN8VxOAJWOZYmcvl50lgCkRGwAKeTERFlrKcu5IKjq0N3Rw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxXYOWyjIdz-gG_7Z-u4DJpQtRAqE21hSnbtNDXIR8AaQ&oe=69B69DA2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": 